# Large source media. Only the web-optimized derivatives in img/ are committed.
#
# source-photos/work/ holds ~890 MB of untouched iOS originals (HEIC + MOV) that
# Logan and Alex hand over in batches. Committing them would bloat the repo
# permanently and stall the push, which is exactly the failure this repo family
# has hit before. Convert to a sized JPEG in img/ and commit that instead.
#
# The whole source-photos tree is ignored, not just the raw formats. The 62 tracked
# .jpg/.png in there were untracked on 2026-08-13 with `git rm -r --cached`, and
# without this directory rule the very next `git add -A` would put all 30 MB straight
# back. Web derivatives belong in img/; nothing under source-photos/ is ever committed.
source-photos/
*.heic
*.HEIC
*.heif
*.HEIF
*.MOV
*.mov
*.dng
*.DNG
*.psd
*.PSD
*.cr2
*.CR2
*.arw
*.ARW

# Secrets, if this repo ever gains a backend
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
local.settings.json
